    // qh bytes at 66..73, and eight scale bytes at 74..81. Eight 32-value sub-blocks: sub-block ib consumes four
    // grid indices at qs[4ib,4ib+4), each nine-bit index combining the byte with bit 2l of qh[ib] at bit 8 and bit
    // 2l+1 at bit 9; scale byte ib at block byte 74 + ib keeps the sub-block's first two groups in its low nibble
